      "translations": {
        "en": "Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ali ibn Ibrahim al-Ja'fari, from Muhammad ibn al-Fadl, from al-Rida (peace be upon him), who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ لِبَعْضِ مَوَالِيهِ يَوْمَ الْفِطْرِ وَ هُوَ يَدْعُو لَهُ يَا فُلَانُ تَقَبَّلَ اللَّهُ مِنْكَ وَ مِنَّا ثُمَّ أَقَامَ حَتَّى كَانَ يَوْمُ الْأَضْحَى فَقَالَ لَهُ يَا فُلَانُ تَقَبَّلَ اللَّهُ مِنَّا وَ مِنْكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said to one of his mawali on the day of al-Fitr, while he was supplicating for him: 'O so-and-so, may Allah accept from you and from us.' Then he remained until the day of al-Adha came, and he said to him: 'O so-and-so, may Allah accept from us and from you.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "قَالَ فَقُلْتُ لَهُ يَا ابْنَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ قُلْتَ فِي الْفِطْرِ شَيْئاً وَ تَقُولُ فِي الْأَضْحَى غَيْرَهُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He (the narrator) said: 'So I said to him: O son of the Messenger of Allah, you said something on the day of al-Fitr, and you are saying something else on the day of al-Adha?'"
